Here is the spoiler to a virtual unlimited supply
of tools and potions:






























Wish for a cursed silver bell.
When applied, it summons wood nymphs.
When you kill a wood nymph, it usually leaves behind a potion
of object detection and a mirror.
If you have a wand of polymorph you can polymorph the tools
into magic markers, and the potions into other potions.
On the other hand, you could dilute the potions into water
then make them into holy water.

If you have a few wishes, this seems to me a pretty good use.

